{"item":{"key":"moment:4289586","id":"4289586","kind":"moment","user":{"id":"23682490","name":"AC娘本体","avatar":"9a4f521a9935939e2408f2c6"},"time":1729699200000,"text":"#或许是个读书笔记#前段时间为了凑免运费，多买了一本书，读得我有点樂\n世界上真的存在龙吗？\n秉承着“认真我就输了”潦草翻开，它竟然成了我近日最能打发时间的读物\n整本收集大量信息，古籍查阅实地探访，感觉出了些宇宙探索编辑部的民科味道【。】\n后面字里行间甚至品出了点小感伤，再探究作者生平…一个有点固执的赤诚小伙蹒跚到白发老人的一生就这么凝聚在几页纸上了\n世界上包有龙的，我决定寄一本给成都龙，以便她寻访同类\n再评论区抽两本 祝愿大伙保持好奇 人生如放白鹿青崖[emot=acfun,2007/]","title":"","images":[],"cover":"","duration":"","views":0,"counts":{"commentCount":248,"likeCount":303,"bananaCount":220,"shareCount":6},"url":"https://m.acfun.cn/communityCircle/moment/4289586","commentsPending":false,"archivedComments":238,"archivedRoots":223,"commentPages":["comments/4289586/all/1.json","comments/4289586/all/2.json","comments/4289586/all/3.json","comments/4289586/all/4.json","comments/4289586/all/5.json","comments/4289586/all/6.json","comments/4289586/all/7.json","comments/4289586/all/8.json","comments/4289586/all/9.json","comments/4289586/all/10.json","comments/4289586/all/11.json","comments/4289586/all/12.json"],"hotPages":[],"threads":{"800554136":{"pages":["comments/4289586/threads/800554136/1.json"],"savedReplies":6,"reportedReplies":6,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"800554136","root":"800554136","user":{"id":"101851","name":"路人甲-R1p","avatar":"743e718f2f6a0d9eca2f3604"},"text":"有点意思，书名就叫《世界上真的存在龙吗？》","time":1729735646632,"floor":3,"likes":31,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":6,"hot":true}},"800558145":{"pages":["comments/4289586/threads/800558145/1.json"],"savedReplies":2,"reportedReplies":2,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"800558145","root":"800558145","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"我读 我读还不行吗","time":1729754779890,"floor":123,"likes":43,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":2,"hot":true}},"800558405":{"pages":["comments/4289586/threads/8005584